至大乾王朝，成为定国公之孙，因揭下女帝武曌的招贤令卷入权谋漩涡。他凭借毒士谋略，智破粮价危机、更以奇计抵御楚国入侵，助女帝稳固江山。最终高阳从纨绔逆袭为户部尚书，成为女帝最锋利的剑，谱写一段狠辣与忠义交织的传奇。","series_id":"7503394973782379545","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623574232FFF3E26D4E96ABBB14\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7503394973782379545\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.04023794084787369,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.1782879829406738,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03327737748622894,\\\"collect\\\":0.06097517907619476,\\\"like\\\":0.07696083933115005,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.4422852993011475,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.25682124495506287}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7503394973782379545","play_cnt":916101,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"河马短剧","sub_title":"逆袭·古装传奇","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":90,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5031,\"name\":\"逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5031&categoryName=逆袭&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5139,\"name\":\"古装传奇\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5139&categoryName=古装传奇&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5137,\"name\":\"朝堂权谋\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5137&categoryName=朝堂权谋&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5155,\"name\":\"权臣篡位\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5155&categoryName=权臣篡位&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryI